      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. the problem is they keep claiming the line ended with Prince Julian in 1924. but they're ignoring the private journals from the estate that prove his youngest daughter was moved to safety before the transition. i have the records but i need to phrase it so it doesn't sound like a conspiracy theory, even though it's the truth. how do i present the connection between the Valerius estate and the hidden branch of the family in a way that sounds like a formal historical correction?",
